,"sourceCharacterId":"21215","sourceWorkId":"8550","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀な優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内向的で自分の意見を主張できず、常に相手の様子を窺っているような女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、苛めに遭っていた女の子を正義感から助けたことから、今度は自分がターゲットにされるようになってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そうしたことから、現在は不登校になってしまった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21215","sourceWorkId":"8965","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある学園の女子生徒。成績優秀かつ品行方正ゆえに学園内で評価されていた一方、一部の同級生のいじめに遭い、登校拒否に陥っていた。その後、音露と出会い、登校拒否から抜け出す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『おかわり一杯目』にも登場する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"164524"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b30ba3722f1a8021e369a6a5aae224266eabfd83afdf8f5a73936bf4b4cb6bb4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/701ccdfdc692da44ad2b3ebd05fc9564de2706bd91442578346dfe7fc8445f43.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中田順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:269980:164524:4463:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24854","characterName":"麻子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"192745","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"269980"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24110"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24854"},"originalCharacterName":"麻子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"由愛子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るい性格で友達も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優秀な姉と比較されることを嫌い、その反発から姉とは対照的な振る舞いを見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それは“自分の存在を認めて欲しい”というアピールでしかない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24110","sourceWorkId":"8550","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に姉の由愛子と比較されることが嫌で反発し、わざと由愛子とは対照的な素行をすることで、自分の存在にも気がついてほしいとメッセージを送りつづけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく友人も多い。登校拒否の姉を少し見下していた。しかし、ここ最近は、自分が引きこもるようになってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"192745"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d740d548706d3f546a368d0f9a27766cf6fd2aa73a8725abf228c7a64d99f951.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf339280eddee32f2bf87859a7ef3bb47aef44383c4d4f0acba33d08c001b0b6.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"愛原瑞生","creatorId":"vndb:s2982","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2982","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2982","name":"愛原 瑞生","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:269980:192745:48769:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c24852","characterName":"亀頭 静香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c24852"},"originalCharacterName":"亀頭 静香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/451929a97e364293b87592d13b1a127c9ecbfb0bb330dff9d1f957aa457c802b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe34324782f5f816835a5085cbe32f7c827e5e492e1cce6b48829ff1de381b72.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かわしま りの","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","ident